    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not a different kind of win. there's no other win. i spent my whole life thinking \"if i just get this, then i'll be happy\" or \"if i reach this peak, it'll all make sense.\" but i'm here now and it's just... quiet. it's like i've finished the book and realized there's no sequel. there's no point in just sitting here in the silence waiting for something else to happen that'll never come.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
